<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong money markets closed for holidays.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong money markets closed for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong money markets are closed on Friday and Monday for the Easter holidays. The markets will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
